{"schemaVersion":2,"root":{"fen":"rnbakabnr/9/1c5c1/p1p1p1p1p/9/9/P1P1P1P1P/1C5C1/9/RNBAKABNR w - - 0 1","comment":"这局棋的特点是：双方布阵严谨，出奇制胜，力争主动，中盘短兵相接，奋力扭杀，残局波澜起伏，耐人寻味。虽然其间不无瑕疵，但千虑一失，智者难免，这盘棋仍属对局中之上品。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9g7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0g2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i9h9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i0h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9c7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c3c4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6g5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h7i7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6g6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i7i8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b0c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2d4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i8g8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g7h5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g9e7","comment":"李来群邀请兑车，陈方避兑压马，寻求复杂变化。现在李方飞起左象，是别出心裁的手段，一些棋手认为，此举若同以往惯用的象3进5相比，另具两项功能：既可避免红四路车点塞象眼捉炮，又能防止红河口马进七再进九直奔卧槽的计划实现。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b2c2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b7b3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e3e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3g3","comment":"李方毅然射兵攻相，便于下一手立即亮出1路车，是深谋远虑的正确决策。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a9b9","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a0a1","comment":"双方调兵谴将，抢占战略要路，力争在布局阶段打下良好基础。目前面临着向中局过渡的关键时刻，一着不慎就会牵一发而动全身。陈孝堃果断地运用双车合围控制局势。实践证明，起用左横车确属当前照应全局的有力措施。其他几种作战方案即兵五进一、兵七进一、马六进七、马六进五等，非缓即躁，均存在某些不够理想之处。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b9b4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c0a2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"a1d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h5i3","comment":"李来群不甘固守，千方百计寻找突破口，制造反攻机会。经过30多分钟的沉思，伸右车骑河扰乱敌阵。陈孝堃平车保马蓄锐待敌。李来群置相对薄弱的己方右翼于不顾，驱马直闯边关，先弃后取，奔袭陈方空虚的侧翼。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g2i3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h9h3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"红不补士，改走车六平四亦属可行。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h3i3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c4c5","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g3g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f3i3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g1d1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d4b3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b4e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"b3d2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4h4","comment":"此刻按常规走法，黑可车5退1，继续牵住红方中炮，先保持子力平衡，再相机而动。岂料河北小将竟自突然平车弃马，图谋集结兵力向陈方底线展开猛攻，由此掀起了中局激战的高潮。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c2c7","comment":"陈孝堃吃掉敌马，接受了李的挑战。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4h0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1f0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d1i1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i2g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i1g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4i2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g1i1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i2g4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i1g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d2e4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g1g0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g8g4","comment":"双方车炮互捉，在棋规上属于允许着法。陈方挟多子之利，主动进马弃相打破僵局。准备炮击中卒，徐图进取。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2e6","comment":"炮轰中卒，朴实简洁。如改走马五进六，则比较凶悍，但有险阻。临枰思考时间有限，陈孝堃舍繁就简，不无见地。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0g1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1f0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g1g0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e0e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h0h1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h1h2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e2e1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2h1","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e1e2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h1h6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e6f6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g0d0","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i3d3","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"g4g0","comment":"陈孝堃成竹在胸，在李来群再度进炮打将，企图将局面复原时，他主动进帅“御驾亲征”。李方双炮沉底连环，以“海底捞月”方式扼守要津，此种战术组合，使人产生耳目一新之感。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c7c6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h6h2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f6f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e4d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d0d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"d3d6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4f4","comment":"由于1小时半必须走满40步的时限迫近，双方动子如飞，难作详尽推敲。一番拼兑，红方破坏了黑方的连环炮，消除了后顾之忧，改善了兵种对比状况。因残局时马的作用比炮教易发挥，故红方稍嫌不够合算。寻根究底，第38回合时，红莫如改走兵七进一，则较有发展前途。","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f2h2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f2h2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f4h4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h2f2","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"e8d7","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"c6i6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"f9e8","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"i6a6","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,"next":[{"move":"h4f4","comment":"","defaultIndex":0,